<title>FRANCE: Floods kill five people in Algeria.</title>
<headline>Floods kill five people in Algeria.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Floods have killed five people in the southern Algerian town of Ksar Chellala, Algerian state-run radio said on Monday.</p>
<p>Lashing rain on Sunday night also caused damage in Ksar Chellala, 190 km (118 miles) south of Algiers, said the radio without elaborating.</p>
